<div class="phead"><div class="w"><ol class="crumbs"><li><a href="{{ PathBase }}/">Home</a></li><li>Houses</li></ol><div class="g"><span class="num">IV</span><div><p class="kick">The house system, since 1903</p><h1>Four houses and <em>the House Cup</em></h1></div></div><p class="lede">Every student from Grade 5 and every teacher belongs to a house. Points for service, music, sport, debate and the quiz; the standings below are drawn on the server from each house's points.</p></div></div><section class="sec tight"><div class="w">{%- assign hs = get_content_items(ContentType="houses", OrderBy="points desc", PageSize=10) -%}{%- assign mx = 1 -%}{% for h in hs.Items limit:1 %}{%- assign mx = h.PublishedContent.points | append: "" | plus: 0 -%}{% endfor %}<div class="cup">{% for h in hs.Items %}{%- assign y=h.PublishedContent -%}{%- capture hc -%}{{ y.color }}{%- endcapture -%}{%- assign hp = y.points | append: "" | plus: 0 -%}{%- assign pct = hp | times: 100 | divided_by: mx | floor -%}<a class="cuprow" href="{{ PathBase }}/{{ h.RoutePath }}" style="--c:{{ hc }}"><img src="{{ y.banner.Value | attachment_redirect_url }}" alt="{{ h.PrimaryField }} house banner (generated)"><span><b>{{ h.PrimaryField }}{% if forloop.first %}<span class="lead">LEADS</span>{% endif %}</b><small>{{ y.motto }}</small></span><span class="bar" aria-hidden="true"><i style="width:{{ pct }}%"></i></span><span class="pts">{{ hp }}</span></a>{% endfor %}</div></div></section>
<section class="sec tight" style="padding-bottom:70px"><div class="w"><div class="portraits">{% for h in Target.Items %}{%- assign y=h.PublishedContent -%}<a class="por" href="{{ PathBase }}/{{ h.RoutePath }}"><img src="{{ y.banner.Value | attachment_redirect_url }}" alt="{{ h.PrimaryField }} banner (generated)" style="aspect-ratio:5/7;object-fit:contain;background:var(--ivory)"><b>{{ h.PrimaryField }}</b><small><i>{{ y.motto }}</i> · {{ y.motto_en }}</small><small>{{ y.summary }}</small></a>{% endfor %}</div></div></section>
